  "directlyReviewed": [
    "All eight candidate full bodies, all four shared-file before bodies, the reversible delta and authored validation metadata were fetched by exact immutable Git blobs and checked for Git blob/SHA256/byte equality.",
    "Five partial-submission hunks, five public-rebind hunks, four builder hunks and two writer prefix insertions reverse to their complete original files byte for byte. Duplicate literal prefix insertions were distinguished by exact line spans.",
    "The helper admits only the two literal source paths and two exact sidecar whole-byte pins. Historical source and original compact are authenticated from immutable commits; the source-change commit is fixed and ancestry to current HEAD is mandatory. Current source, dictionary, authority files and identity inputs are authenticated as current regular files with exact HEAD binding.",
    "The current full source banks have fixed byte pins and exact per-row historical/current whole hashes. All47 canonical UID/ordinal/display joins are checked. Only5 plus11 selected questions are whole-equal; changed M3Q8 stays in the original12-item partition and is explicitly excluded from the restored11.",
    "Original evidence is not synthesized. The helper calls the unchanged partial receipt, quote/structure binding, original append acceptance and public mixed-rebind/native/renderer checks using an authenticated historical source view. The original private append5 and public mixed12 contracts must complete, including their exact prior compact chains.",
    "The historical token is an opaque module-private WeakMap capability. It binds root, current HEAD, complete compact arguments, source bytes/bank, identity records, dictionary and chain depth. The public-rebind view is available only once for the fixed M3 subject and exact original input/acceptance refs. Tokens are deleted in finally, synchronous results are required, and live files are rehashed before/after original validation.",
    "The ordinary path with undefined historical context retains its original source, acceptance, quote, native, asset and whole-output checks. Unrelated sources return no named continuation; a missing sidecar falls back to the original rejection of the current source mismatch. No caller-supplied boolean or fabricated context can authorize history.",
    "The builder parses only the two named banks using strict JSON-data parsing, for both current and historical source bytes; unrelated bank parsing is unchanged. Original evidence verification occurs before cache reuse. The helper participates in BUILDER_SHA, and current authority/input hashes enter evidenceDigests/contractSha256 and the ordinary final observed-input checks.",
    "The builder's existing current-versus-historical student-payload guard is unchanged and still rejects M3Q8. No vector, compact, original receipt, source, identity, or unsubmitted partition is rewritten.",
    "The two writer additions are the identical exact directory prefix in fourSlot input fingerprinting and immutable input preservation. They add no generated-output allowance, producer command, registration permission, or new authority."
  ],
